  "description": "Buckley Real Estate are delighted to bring this beautiful 1 bed to the Dublin rental market.\n\nJust a short stroll either direction from the villages of Ranelagh and Rathmines, the city centre is only a little further beyond, providing the discerning purchaser with a wealth of amenities on their doorstep both social and essential including shops, bars, restaurants and many of the City's premier secondary schools. Ranelagh has excellent transport facilities and the property is just a gentle stroll from the Luas Station at Ranelagh and Beechwood giving swift access to St. Stephen's Green and Dundrum Town Centre.\n\nWe look forward to showing you around this wonderful property. Being within a leisurely stroll of St Stephens Green and adjacent to the enviable choice of superb shops, bars and restaurants at both Ranelagh and Rathmines, the convenience of the location speaks for itself. The Omniplex and Stella provide cinema options at Rathmines, and in the other direction, the LUAS at Ranelagh is a 5 minute walk. To complete the picture, no 15 is nestled with immediate access to Belgrave Square and its beautiful fusion of open greenery, mature trees",
